-- EU AI Act serious-incident reporting: the PROVIDER's questions.
-- DRAFT. Not for use as advice. Not reviewed by a domain expert or by a lawyer
-- qualified in EU law. See NOTES.md.
--
-- The baseline (seat) module. Each question is the provider's own, takes
-- plain inputs the provider can state, builds the records of aia-domain.l4,
-- and calls the rules in the other modules; it restates no rule.
-- The text of the Regulation in force on the date asked about is used: as
-- enacted before 27 July 2026, as amended by Regulation (EU) 2026/1744 from
-- that day. GENERATED by gen_seat.py in the session scratchpad; edit with care.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-domain`
IMPORT `aia-dates`
IMPORT `aia-definitions`
IMPORT `aia-art73`
IMPORT `aia-gpai`
IMPORT `aia-penalties`

§ `Provider seat`

§§ `Building the records from the answers`

GIVEN develops_model IS A BOOLEAN, places_model IS A BOOLEAN, is_gpai IS A BOOLEAN, training_flops IS A NUMBER, hic_evaluated IS A BOOLEAN, designated IS A BOOLEAN, arguments_accepted IS A BOOLEAN, model_placed_date IS A DATE
GIVETH A `model facts`
`my model from my answers` develops_model places_model is_gpai training_flops hic_evaluated designated arguments_accepted model_placed_date MEANS
    `model facts` WITH
        `I develop the model or have it developed` IS develops_model
        `I place the model on the market under my own name or trademark` IS places_model
        `it is a general-purpose AI model` IS is_gpai
        `the cumulative training computation in floating point operations` IS training_flops
        `an evaluation with appropriate technical tools found high impact capabilities` IS hic_evaluated
        `the Commission has designated it a model with systemic risk` IS designated
        `the Commission has accepted my Article 52(2) arguments` IS arguments_accepted
        `the date the model was first placed on the market` IS model_placed_date

GIVEN from_ai_system IS A BOOLEAN, death IS A BOOLEAN, health IS A BOOLEAN, infrastructure IS A BOOLEAN, rights IS A BOOLEAN, property IS A BOOLEAN, contrary_to_union_law IS A BOOLEAN, other_member_states IS A NUMBER, common_features IS A BOOLEAN, same_operator IS A BOOLEAN, concurrent_member_states IS A NUMBER, aware_date IS A DATE
GIVETH AN `incident facts`
`my incident from my answers` from_ai_system death health infrastructure rights property contrary_to_union_law other_member_states common_features same_operator concurrent_member_states aware_date MEANS
    `incident facts` WITH
        `it is an incident or malfunctioning of the AI system` IS from_ai_system
        `it led, directly or indirectly, to the death of a person` IS death
        `it led, directly or indirectly, to serious harm to the health of a person` IS health
        `it led, directly or indirectly, to a serious and irreversible disruption of critical infrastructure` IS infrastructure
        `it led, directly or indirectly, to an infringement of Union-law obligations protecting fundamental rights` IS rights
        `it led, directly or indirectly, to serious harm to property or the environment` IS property
        `it is an act or omission contrary to Union law protecting the interest of individuals` IS contrary_to_union_law
        `the number of other Member States whose residents it harmed or is likely to harm` IS other_member_states
        `it has common features, such as the same unlawful practice or interest infringed` IS common_features
        `it is committed by the same operator` IS same_operator
        `the number of Member States in which it is occurring concurrently` IS concurrent_member_states
        `the date I became aware of it` IS aware_date

-- For Article 55(1)(c) only the Article 3(49) facts are read. The other
-- fields are fixed placeholders that no rule on that path reads.
GIVEN from_ai_system IS A BOOLEAN, death IS A BOOLEAN, health IS A BOOLEAN, infrastructure IS A BOOLEAN, rights IS A BOOLEAN, property IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `incident facts`
`my model incident from my answers` from_ai_system death health infrastructure rights property MEANS
    `my incident from my answers` from_ai_system death health infrastructure rights property FALSE 0 FALSE FALSE 0 (Date 1 1 2000)

GIVEN develops_system IS A BOOLEAN, places_system IS A BOOLEAN, own_name IS A BOOLEAN, route IS A `high-risk route`, on_union_market IS A BOOLEAN, system_placed_date IS A DATE, design_changed IS A BOOLEAN, design_change_date IS A DATE, for_public_authorities IS A BOOLEAN, own_gpai IS A BOOLEAN, annex_iii_point_2 IS A BOOLEAN, annex_iii_point_8_justice IS A BOOLEAN, article_74_6 IS A BOOLEAN, vlop IS A BOOLEAN, medical_device IS A BOOLEAN, equivalent_reporting IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `AI system facts`
`my system from my answers` develops_system places_system own_name route on_union_market system_placed_date design_changed design_change_date for_public_authorities own_gpai annex_iii_point_2 annex_iii_point_8_justice article_74_6 vlop medical_device equivalent_reporting MEANS
    `AI system facts` WITH
        `I develop the system or have it developed` IS develops_system
        `I place the system on the market or put it into service` IS places_system
        `the system carries my own name or trademark` IS own_name
        `the route by which the system is high-risk` IS route
        `the system has been placed on the Union market` IS on_union_market
        `the date the system was first placed on the market or put into service` IS system_placed_date
        `the date of the latest significant change to its design, if any` IS (IF design_changed THEN JUST design_change_date ELSE NOTHING)
        `the system is intended to be used by public authorities` IS for_public_authorities
        `the system is based on a general-purpose AI model from me or my undertaking` IS own_gpai
        `the system is listed in point 2 of Annex III` IS annex_iii_point_2
        `the system is listed in point 8 of Annex III for the administration of justice` IS annex_iii_point_8_justice
        `the system is provided by an authority or financial institution within Article 74(6)` IS article_74_6
        `the system is or is part of a designated very large online platform or search engine` IS vlop
        `the system is or is a safety component of a device under Regulation 2017/745 or 2017/746` IS medical_device
        `I am subject to Union instruments with equivalent incident-reporting obligations` IS equivalent_reporting

§§ `General-purpose AI models with systemic risk (Articles 51, 52, 55 and 101)`

@export Am I a provider of a general-purpose AI model with systemic risk under Article 51 of the EU AI Act?
GIVEN develops_model     IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Do you develop the model, or have it developed?
      places_model       IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Do you place the model on the EU market under your own name or trademark?
      is_gpai            IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Is it a general-purpose AI model: one that displays significant generality and can competently perform a wide range of distinct tasks (Article 3(63))?
      training_flops     IS A NUMBER, @desc The cumulative computation used to train the model, in floating point operations, as a whole number (10^25 is 10000000000000000000000000).
      hic_evaluated      IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Has an evaluation with appropriate technical tools and methodologies found that the model has high impact capabilities (Article 51(1)(a))?
      designated         IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Has the Commission designated the model as a general-purpose AI model with systemic risk (Article 51(1)(b) or 52(4))?
      arguments_accepted IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Has the Commission accepted arguments you presented under Article 52(2) that the model does not present systemic risks? Answer false if you presented none.
      model_placed_date  IS A DATE @desc The date you first placed the model on the market, ISO 8601.
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Am I a provider of a general-purpose AI model with systemic risk` develops_model places_model is_gpai training_flops hic_evaluated designated arguments_accepted model_placed_date MEANS
    `I am the provider of the model` (`my model from my answers` develops_model places_model is_gpai training_flops hic_evaluated designated arguments_accepted model_placed_date) AND `my model is a general-purpose AI model with systemic risk` (`my model from my answers` develops_model places_model is_gpai training_flops hic_evaluated designated arguments_accepted model_placed_date)

@export By when must I notify the European Commission that my general-purpose AI model meets the Article 51(1)(a) high-impact condition (EU AI Act Article 52(1))?
GIVEN develops_model     IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Do you develop the model, or have it developed?
      places_model       IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Do you place the model on the EU market under your own name or trademark?
      is_gpai            IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Is it a general-purpose AI model: one that displays significant generality and can competently perform a wide range of distinct tasks (Article 3(63))?
      training_flops     IS A NUMBER, @desc The cumulative computation used to train the model, in floating point operations, as a whole number (10^25 is 10000000000000000000000000).
      hic_evaluated      IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Has an evaluation with appropriate technical tools and methodologies found that the model has high impact capabilities (Article 51(1)(a))?
      designated         IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Has the Commission designated the model as a general-purpose AI model with systemic risk (Article 51(1)(b) or 52(4))?
      arguments_accepted IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Has the Commission accepted arguments you presented under Article 52(2) that the model does not present systemic risks? Answer false if you presented none.
      model_placed_date  IS A DATE, @desc The date you first placed the model on the market, ISO 8601.
      condition_date     IS A DATE @desc The date the model met the condition, or the earlier date on which it became known that it would, ISO 8601.
GIVETH A `deadline`
`By when must I notify the Commission under Article 52(1)` develops_model places_model is_gpai training_flops hic_evaluated designated arguments_accepted model_placed_date condition_date MEANS
    `by when must I notify the Commission under Article 52(1)` (`my model from my answers` develops_model places_model is_gpai training_flops hic_evaluated designated arguments_accepted model_placed_date) condition_date

-- Asked when a serious incident has happened involving the model.

@export By when must I report a serious incident involving my general-purpose AI model with systemic risk (EU AI Act Article 55(1)(c))? The Act states no number of days.
GIVEN as_of_date         IS A DATE, @desc The date your question is about, ISO 8601 (e.g. 2028-03-01). It decides which text of the Regulation applies (the Omnibus amendments are in force from 2026-07-27) and whether the duty has started.
      develops_model     IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Do you develop the model, or have it developed?
      places_model       IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Do you place the model on the EU market under your own name or trademark?
      is_gpai            IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Is it a general-purpose AI model: one that displays significant generality and can competently perform a wide range of distinct tasks (Article 3(63))?
      training_flops     IS A NUMBER, @desc The cumulative computation used to train the model, in floating point operations, as a whole number (10^25 is 10000000000000000000000000).
      hic_evaluated      IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Has an evaluation with appropriate technical tools and methodologies found that the model has high impact capabilities (Article 51(1)(a))?
      designated         IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Has the Commission designated the model as a general-purpose AI model with systemic risk (Article 51(1)(b) or 52(4))?
      arguments_accepted IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Has the Commission accepted arguments you presented under Article 52(2) that the model does not present systemic risks? Answer false if you presented none.
      model_placed_date  IS A DATE, @desc The date you first placed the model on the market, ISO 8601.
      from_ai_system     IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Was this an incident or malfunctioning of an AI system?
      death              IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Did it lead, directly or indirectly, to the death of a person?
      health             IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Did it lead, directly or indirectly, to serious harm to a person's health?
      infrastructure     IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Did it lead, directly or indirectly, to a serious and irreversible disruption of the management or operation of critical infrastructure?
      rights             IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Did it lead, directly or indirectly, to an infringement of obligations under Union law intended to protect fundamental rights?
      property           IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did it lead, directly or indirectly, to serious harm to property or the environment?
GIVETH A `deadline`
`By when must I report a serious incident involving my model` as_of_date develops_model places_model is_gpai training_flops hic_evaluated designated arguments_accepted model_placed_date from_ai_system death health infrastructure rights property MEANS
    `by when must I report under Article 55(1)(c)` as_of_date (`my model from my answers` develops_model places_model is_gpai training_flops hic_evaluated designated arguments_accepted model_placed_date) (`my model incident from my answers` from_ai_system death health infrastructure rights property)

@export To whom must I report a serious incident involving my general-purpose AI model with systemic risk (EU AI Act Article 55(1)(c))?
GIVEN as_of_date         IS A DATE, @desc The date your question is about, ISO 8601 (e.g. 2028-03-01). It decides which text of the Regulation applies (the Omnibus amendments are in force from 2026-07-27) and whether the duty has started.
      develops_model     IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Do you develop the model, or have it developed?
      places_model       IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Do you place the model on the EU market under your own name or trademark?
      is_gpai            IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Is it a general-purpose AI model: one that displays significant generality and can competently perform a wide range of distinct tasks (Article 3(63))?
      training_flops     IS A NUMBER, @desc The cumulative computation used to train the model, in floating point operations, as a whole number (10^25 is 10000000000000000000000000).
      hic_evaluated      IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Has an evaluation with appropriate technical tools and methodologies found that the model has high impact capabilities (Article 51(1)(a))?
      designated         IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Has the Commission designated the model as a general-purpose AI model with systemic risk (Article 51(1)(b) or 52(4))?
      arguments_accepted IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Has the Commission accepted arguments you presented under Article 52(2) that the model does not present systemic risks? Answer false if you presented none.
      model_placed_date  IS A DATE, @desc The date you first placed the model on the market, ISO 8601.
      from_ai_system     IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Was this an incident or malfunctioning of an AI system?
      death              IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Did it lead, directly or indirectly, to the death of a person?
      health             IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Did it lead, directly or indirectly, to serious harm to a person's health?
      infrastructure     IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Did it lead, directly or indirectly, to a serious and irreversible disruption of the management or operation of critical infrastructure?
      rights             IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Did it lead, directly or indirectly, to an infringement of obligations under Union law intended to protect fundamental rights?
      property           IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did it lead, directly or indirectly, to serious harm to property or the environment?
GIVETH A `recipient`
`To whom must I report a serious incident involving my model` as_of_date develops_model places_model is_gpai training_flops hic_evaluated designated arguments_accepted model_placed_date from_ai_system death health infrastructure rights property MEANS
    `to whom must I report under Article 55(1)(c)` as_of_date (`my model from my answers` develops_model places_model is_gpai training_flops hic_evaluated designated arguments_accepted model_placed_date) (`my model incident from my answers` from_ai_system death health infrastructure rights property)

@export What is the most the Commission can fine me for not reporting a serious incident involving my general-purpose AI model with systemic risk (EU AI Act Article 101)?
GIVEN as_of_date         IS A DATE, @desc The date your question is about, ISO 8601 (e.g. 2028-03-01). It decides which text of the Regulation applies (the Omnibus amendments are in force from 2026-07-27) and whether the duty has started.
      develops_model     IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Do you develop the model, or have it developed?
      places_model       IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Do you place the model on the EU market under your own name or trademark?
      is_gpai            IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Is it a general-purpose AI model: one that displays significant generality and can competently perform a wide range of distinct tasks (Article 3(63))?
      training_flops     IS A NUMBER, @desc The cumulative computation used to train the model, in floating point operations, as a whole number (10^25 is 10000000000000000000000000).
      hic_evaluated      IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Has an evaluation with appropriate technical tools and methodologies found that the model has high impact capabilities (Article 51(1)(a))?
      designated         IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Has the Commission designated the model as a general-purpose AI model with systemic risk (Article 51(1)(b) or 52(4))?
      arguments_accepted IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Has the Commission accepted arguments you presented under Article 52(2) that the model does not present systemic risks? Answer false if you presented none.
      model_placed_date  IS A DATE, @desc The date you first placed the model on the market, ISO 8601.
      from_ai_system     IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Was this an incident or malfunctioning of an AI system?
      death              IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Did it lead, directly or indirectly, to the death of a person?
      health             IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Did it lead, directly or indirectly, to serious harm to a person's health?
      infrastructure     IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Did it lead, directly or indirectly, to a serious and irreversible disruption of the management or operation of critical infrastructure?
      rights             IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Did it lead, directly or indirectly, to an infringement of obligations under Union law intended to protect fundamental rights?
      property           IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Did it lead, directly or indirectly, to serious harm to property or the environment?
      turnover           IS A NUMBER @desc Your total worldwide annual turnover for the preceding financial year, in euros.
GIVETH A `maximum fine`
`What is the most I can be fined for not reporting a serious incident involving my model` as_of_date develops_model places_model is_gpai training_flops hic_evaluated designated arguments_accepted model_placed_date from_ai_system death health infrastructure rights property turnover MEANS
    `the most I can be fined for not reporting under Article 55(1)(c)` as_of_date (`my model from my answers` develops_model places_model is_gpai training_flops hic_evaluated designated arguments_accepted model_placed_date) (`my model incident from my answers` from_ai_system death health infrastructure rights property) turnover

§§ `High-risk AI systems: a serious incident has happened (Articles 73 and 75)`
-- Asked when an incident has happened involving the provider's AI system.

@export Must I report this incident involving my high-risk AI system to an authority under EU AI Act Article 73?
GIVEN as_of_date                IS A DATE, @desc The date your question is about, ISO 8601 (e.g. 2028-03-01). It decides which text of the Regulation applies (the Omnibus amendments are in force from 2026-07-27). Whether the Article 73 duty applies is judged on the date you became aware of the incident (aware_date), not on this date.
      develops_system           IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Do you develop the AI system, or have it developed?
      places_system             IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Do you place the AI system on the market or put it into service?
      own_name                  IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Does the AI system carry your own name or trademark?
      route                     IS A `high-risk route`, @desc How is the system high-risk? One of: "not a high-risk AI system", "Article 6(1), product under Section A of Annex I", "Article 6(1), product under Section B of Annex I", "Article 6(2), listed in Annex III".
      on_union_market           IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Has the system been placed on the EU market?
      system_placed_date        IS A DATE, @desc The date the system was first placed on the market or put into service, ISO 8601.
      design_changed            IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Has the system's design been significantly changed since it was first placed on the market?
      design_change_date        IS A DATE, @desc If so, the date of the latest significant design change, ISO 8601 (ignored if there was none).
      for_public_authorities    IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Is the system intended to be used by public authorities?
      own_gpai                  IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Is the system based on a general-purpose AI model developed by you or by a company in your group (undertaking)?
      annex_iii_point_2         IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Is the system listed in point 2 of Annex III (critical infrastructure)?
      annex_iii_point_8_justice IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Is the system listed in point 8 of Annex III as regards the administration of justice?
      article_74_6              IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Is the system provided by a law enforcement authority, a border management authority or a financial institution, within Article 74(6)?
      vlop                      IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Does the system constitute, or is it integrated into, a designated very large online platform or very large online search engine?
      medical_device            IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Is the system a medical or in vitro diagnostic device under Regulation (EU) 2017/745 or 2017/746, or a safety component of one?
      equivalent_reporting      IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Are you subject to other Union legislation laying down incident-reporting obligations equivalent to the AI Act's?
      from_ai_system            IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Was this an incident or malfunctioning of an AI system?
      death                     IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Did it lead, directly or indirectly, to the death of a person?
      health                    IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Did it lead, directly or indirectly, to serious harm to a person's health?
      infrastructure            IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Did it lead, directly or indirectly, to a serious and irreversible disruption of the management or operation of critical infrastructure?
      rights                    IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Did it lead, directly or indirectly, to an infringement of obligations under Union law intended to protect fundamental rights?
      property                  IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Did it lead, directly or indirectly, to serious harm to property or the environment?
      contrary_to_union_law     IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Is it an act or omission contrary to Union law protecting the interest of individuals?
      other_member_states       IS A NUMBER, @desc In how many Member States, other than the one where it originated or where you or the deployer are established, has it harmed or is it likely to harm the collective interests of residents?
      common_features           IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Does it have common features, such as the same unlawful practice or the same interest infringed, across Member States?
      same_operator             IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Is it committed by the same operator in each Member State?
      concurrent_member_states  IS A NUMBER, @desc In how many Member States is it occurring concurrently?
      aware_date                IS A DATE @desc The date you became aware of the serious incident, ISO 8601.
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Must I report this incident involving my high-risk AI system` as_of_date develops_system places_system own_name route on_union_market system_placed_date design_changed design_change_date for_public_authorities own_gpai annex_iii_point_2 annex_iii_point_8_justice article_74_6 vlop medical_device equivalent_reporting from_ai_system death health infrastructure rights property contrary_to_union_law other_member_states common_features same_operator concurrent_member_states aware_date MEANS
    `must I report the incident under Article 73` as_of_date (`the version in force on` as_of_date) (`my system from my answers` develops_system places_system own_name route on_union_market system_placed_date design_changed design_change_date for_public_authorities own_gpai annex_iii_point_2 annex_iii_point_8_justice article_74_6 vlop medical_device equivalent_reporting) (`my incident from my answers` from_ai_system death health infrastructure rights property contrary_to_union_law other_member_states common_features same_operator concurrent_member_states aware_date)

@export To whom must I report this serious incident involving my high-risk AI system (EU AI Act Article 73(1), 73(10), 75(1a))?
GIVEN as_of_date                IS A DATE, @desc The date your question is about, ISO 8601 (e.g. 2028-03-01). It decides which text of the Regulation applies (the Omnibus amendments are in force from 2026-07-27). Whether the Article 73 duty applies is judged on the date you became aware of the incident (aware_date), not on this date.
      develops_system           IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Do you develop the AI system, or have it developed?
      places_system             IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Do you place the AI system on the market or put it into service?
      own_name                  IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Does the AI system carry your own name or trademark?
      route                     IS A `high-risk route`, @desc How is the system high-risk? One of: "not a high-risk AI system", "Article 6(1), product under Section A of Annex I", "Article 6(1), product under Section B of Annex I", "Article 6(2), listed in Annex III".
      on_union_market           IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Has the system been placed on the EU market?
      system_placed_date        IS A DATE, @desc The date the system was first placed on the market or put into service, ISO 8601.
      design_changed            IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Has the system's design been significantly changed since it was first placed on the market?
      design_change_date        IS A DATE, @desc If so, the date of the latest significant design change, ISO 8601 (ignored if there was none).
      for_public_authorities    IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Is the system intended to be used by public authorities?
      own_gpai                  IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Is the system based on a general-purpose AI model developed by you or by a company in your group (undertaking)?
      annex_iii_point_2         IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Is the system listed in point 2 of Annex III (critical infrastructure)?
      annex_iii_point_8_justice IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Is the system listed in point 8 of Annex III as regards the administration of justice?
      article_74_6              IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Is the system provided by a law enforcement authority, a border management authority or a financial institution, within Article 74(6)?
      vlop                      IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Does the system constitute, or is it integrated into, a designated very large online platform or very large online search engine?
      medical_device            IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Is the system a medical or in vitro diagnostic device under Regulation (EU) 2017/745 or 2017/746, or a safety component of one?
      equivalent_reporting      IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Are you subject to other Union legislation laying down incident-reporting obligations equivalent to the AI Act's?
      from_ai_system            IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Was this an incident or malfunctioning of an AI system?
      death                     IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Did it lead, directly or indirectly, to the death of a person?
      health                    IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Did it lead, directly or indirectly, to serious harm to a person's health?
      infrastructure            IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Did it lead, directly or indirectly, to a serious and irreversible disruption of the management or operation of critical infrastructure?
      rights                    IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Did it lead, directly or indirectly, to an infringement of obligations under Union law intended to protect fundamental rights?
      property                  IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Did it lead, directly or indirectly, to serious harm to property or the environment?
      contrary_to_union_law     IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Is it an act or omission contrary to Union law protecting the interest of individuals?
      other_member_states       IS A NUMBER, @desc In how many Member States, other than the one where it originated or where you or the deployer are established, has it harmed or is it likely to harm the collective interests of residents?
      common_features           IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Does it have common features, such as the same unlawful practice or the same interest infringed, across Member States?
      same_operator             IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Is it committed by the same operator in each Member State?
      concurrent_member_states  IS A NUMBER, @desc In how many Member States is it occurring concurrently?
      aware_date                IS A DATE @desc The date you became aware of the serious incident, ISO 8601.
GIVETH A `recipient`
`To whom must I report this incident involving my high-risk AI system` as_of_date develops_system places_system own_name route on_union_market system_placed_date design_changed design_change_date for_public_authorities own_gpai annex_iii_point_2 annex_iii_point_8_justice article_74_6 vlop medical_device equivalent_reporting from_ai_system death health infrastructure rights property contrary_to_union_law other_member_states common_features same_operator concurrent_member_states aware_date MEANS
    `to whom must I report under Article 73` as_of_date (`the version in force on` as_of_date) (`my system from my answers` develops_system places_system own_name route on_union_market system_placed_date design_changed design_change_date for_public_authorities own_gpai annex_iii_point_2 annex_iii_point_8_justice article_74_6 vlop medical_device equivalent_reporting) (`my incident from my answers` from_ai_system death health infrastructure rights property contrary_to_union_law other_member_states common_features same_operator concurrent_member_states aware_date)

@export What is the latest day by which I must report this serious incident involving my high-risk AI system (EU AI Act Article 73(2) to (4))? The report is also due immediately once a causal link is established.
GIVEN as_of_date                IS A DATE, @desc The date your question is about, ISO 8601 (e.g. 2028-03-01). It decides which text of the Regulation applies (the Omnibus amendments are in force from 2026-07-27). Whether the Article 73 duty applies is judged on the date you became aware of the incident (aware_date), not on this date.
      develops_system           IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Do you develop the AI system, or have it developed?
      places_system             IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Do you place the AI system on the market or put it into service?
      own_name                  IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Does the AI system carry your own name or trademark?
      route                     IS A `high-risk route`, @desc How is the system high-risk? One of: "not a high-risk AI system", "Article 6(1), product under Section A of Annex I", "Article 6(1), product under Section B of Annex I", "Article 6(2), listed in Annex III".
      on_union_market           IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Has the system been placed on the EU market?
      system_placed_date        IS A DATE, @desc The date the system was first placed on the market or put into service, ISO 8601.
      design_changed            IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Has the system's design been significantly changed since it was first placed on the market?
      design_change_date        IS A DATE, @desc If so, the date of the latest significant design change, ISO 8601 (ignored if there was none).
      for_public_authorities    IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Is the system intended to be used by public authorities?
      own_gpai                  IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Is the system based on a general-purpose AI model developed by you or by a company in your group (undertaking)?
      annex_iii_point_2         IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Is the system listed in point 2 of Annex III (critical infrastructure)?
      annex_iii_point_8_justice IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Is the system listed in point 8 of Annex III as regards the administration of justice?
      article_74_6              IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Is the system provided by a law enforcement authority, a border management authority or a financial institution, within Article 74(6)?
      vlop                      IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Does the system constitute, or is it integrated into, a designated very large online platform or very large online search engine?
      medical_device            IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Is the system a medical or in vitro diagnostic device under Regulation (EU) 2017/745 or 2017/746, or a safety component of one?
      equivalent_reporting      IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Are you subject to other Union legislation laying down incident-reporting obligations equivalent to the AI Act's?
      from_ai_system            IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Was this an incident or malfunctioning of an AI system?
      death                     IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Did it lead, directly or indirectly, to the death of a person?
      health                    IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Did it lead, directly or indirectly, to serious harm to a person's health?
      infrastructure            IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Did it lead, directly or indirectly, to a serious and irreversible disruption of the management or operation of critical infrastructure?
      rights                    IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Did it lead, directly or indirectly, to an infringement of obligations under Union law intended to protect fundamental rights?
      property                  IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Did it lead, directly or indirectly, to serious harm to property or the environment?
      contrary_to_union_law     IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Is it an act or omission contrary to Union law protecting the interest of individuals?
      other_member_states       IS A NUMBER, @desc In how many Member States, other than the one where it originated or where you or the deployer are established, has it harmed or is it likely to harm the collective interests of residents?
      common_features           IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Does it have common features, such as the same unlawful practice or the same interest infringed, across Member States?
      same_operator             IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Is it committed by the same operator in each Member State?
      concurrent_member_states  IS A NUMBER, @desc In how many Member States is it occurring concurrently?
      aware_date                IS A DATE @desc The date you became aware of the serious incident, ISO 8601.
GIVETH A `deadline`
`By when must I report this incident involving my high-risk AI system` as_of_date develops_system places_system own_name route on_union_market system_placed_date design_changed design_change_date for_public_authorities own_gpai annex_iii_point_2 annex_iii_point_8_justice article_74_6 vlop medical_device equivalent_reporting from_ai_system death health infrastructure rights property contrary_to_union_law other_member_states common_features same_operator concurrent_member_states aware_date MEANS
    `by when must I report under Article 73` as_of_date (`the version in force on` as_of_date) (`my system from my answers` develops_system places_system own_name route on_union_market system_placed_date design_changed design_change_date for_public_authorities own_gpai annex_iii_point_2 annex_iii_point_8_justice article_74_6 vlop medical_device equivalent_reporting) (`my incident from my answers` from_ai_system death health infrastructure rights property contrary_to_union_law other_member_states common_features same_operator concurrent_member_states aware_date)

