GIVEN as_of_date                IS A DATE, @desc The date your question is about, ISO 8601 (e.g. 2028-03-01). It decides which text of the Regulation applies (the Omnibus amendments are in force from 2026-07-27). Whether the Article 73 duty applies is judged on the date you became aware of the incident (aware_date), not on this date.
      develops_system           IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Do you develop the AI system, or have it developed?
