      design_change_date        IS A DATE, @desc If so, the date of the latest significant design change, ISO 8601 (ignored if there was none).
      for_public_authorities    IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Is the system intended to be used by public authorities?
      own_gpai                  IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Is the system based on a general-purpose AI model developed by you or by a company in your group (undertaking)?
      annex_iii_point_2         IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Is the system listed in point 2 of Annex III (critical infrastructure)?
      annex_iii_point_8_justice IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Is the system listed in point 8 of Annex III as regards the administration of justice?
      article_74_6              IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Is the system provided by a law enforcement authority, a border management authority or a financial institution, within Article 74(6)?
      vlop                      IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Does the system constitute, or is it integrated into, a designated very large online platform or very large online search engine?
      medical_device            IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Is the system a medical or in vitro diagnostic device under Regulation (EU) 2017/745 or 2017/746, or a safety component of one?
      equivalent_reporting      IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Are you subject to other Union legislation laying down incident-reporting obligations equivalent to the AI Act's?
      from_ai_system            IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Was this an incident or malfunctioning of an AI system?
      death                     IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Did it lead, directly or indirectly, to the death of a person?
      health                    IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Did it lead, directly or indirectly, to serious harm to a person's health?
      infrastructure            IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Did it lead, directly or indirectly, to a serious and irreversible disruption of the management or operation of critical infrastructure?
      rights                    IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Did it lead, directly or indirectly, to an infringement of obligations under Union law intended to protect fundamental rights?
      property                  IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Did it lead, directly or indirectly, to serious harm to property or the environment?
      contrary_to_union_law     IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Is it an act or omission contrary to Union law protecting the interest of individuals?
      other_member_states       IS A NUMBER, @desc In how many Member States, other than the one where it originated or where you or the deployer are established, has it harmed or is it likely to harm the collective interests of residents?
      common_features           IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Does it have common features, such as the same unlawful practice or the same interest infringed, across Member States?
      same_operator             IS A BOOLEAN, @desc Is it committed by the same operator in each Member State?
      concurrent_member_states  IS A NUMBER, @desc In how many Member States is it occurring concurrently?
      aware_date                IS A DATE, @desc The date you became aware of the serious incident, ISO 8601.
      size                      IS A `size of the provider`, @desc Your size. One of: "an SME, including a start-up", "an SMC, a small mid-cap enterprise", "another undertaking", "not an undertaking".
      turnover                  IS A NUMBER @desc Your total worldwide annual turnover for the preceding financial year, in euros.
GIVETH A `maximum fine`
